<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 340" role="img" aria-labelledby="hk-t hk-d" class="fig-dark" style="background:#131736">
    <title id="hk-t">Three different halfway points between the same two places</title>
    <desc id="hk-d">Place A on the left and place B on the right. A dashed straight line joins them with its midpoint marked in the middle. A winding road also joins them; its halfway point by distance sits partway along the road, and its halfway point by time sits closer to A, where the road runs slowly through town.</desc>
    <rect x="40" y="200" width="150" height="100" rx="14" fill="#1d2356" />
    <text x="115" y="290" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Archivo Variable, Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#8c93c9">slow town streets</text>
    <rect x="470" y="40" width="250" height="44" rx="12" fill="#1d2356" />
    <text x="595" y="67" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Archivo Variable, Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#8c93c9">fast highway</text>
    <path d="M100 230 L660 150" stroke="#ff5fb4" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="8 8" />
    <path d="M100 230 C 150 280, 220 260, 250 220 S 330 110, 420 90 S 560 60, 660 150" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.18" />
    <path d="M100 230 C 150 280, 220 260, 250 220 S 330 110, 420 90 S 560 60, 660 150" fill="none" stroke="#e6e8f7" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <g font-family="Archivo Variable, Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif">
      <circle cx="100" cy="230" r="17" fill="#fff" stroke="#c4157a" stroke-width="4" /><text x="100" y="235.5" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="800" fill="#161b3d">A</text>
      <circle cx="660" cy="150" r="17" fill="#fff" stroke="#c4157a" stroke-width="4" /><text x="660" y="155.5" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="800" fill="#161b3d">B</text>
      <circle cx="380" cy="190" r="15" fill="#c4157a" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" /><text x="380" y="195" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="800" fill="#fff">½</text>
      <text x="380" y="228" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="#ff8fca">straight line midpoint</text>
      <circle cx="338" cy="122" r="15" fill="#161b3d" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" /><text x="338" y="127" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="800" fill="#fff">½</text>
      <text x="300" y="84" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="#e6e8f7">halfway by road distance</text>
      <circle cx="252" cy="218" r="15" fill="#0f8a6c" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" /><text x="252" y="223" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="800" fill="#fff">⏱</text>
      <text x="252" y="186" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="#7fe0c0">halfway by drive time</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>The same trip has three different halfway points. Where one end of the route is slow, the halfway point by time moves toward that end, because the slow part takes longer to cover.</figcaption>
</figure>
